1 cream parchment NAMEPLATE with thin gold rim, blankmiddle;
2 dark walnut ENERGY TRACK with bronze rim, long inset emptydark center, nofill;
3 bright golden yellow ENERGY FILL CAPSULE, solid luminousyellowmiddle withsoft creamhighlight, noframeornumbers;
4 lime emerald DEPLOY BUTTON blank, rich bevelled roundedgoldborder, noarrowicon orwords;
5 slate-blue CHARGING BUTTON blank, matching gold/steel bevel, dimblue-grayflatcenter, NOwords;
6 cream/brass FORMATION BUTTON blank, darkerwoodouterrim, noicon orwords;
7 golden circular REPEAT ARROW ICON ONLY, two curvedarrows loop isolated againstalpha, a small compact roundicon centered in slot, NOrectanglebuttonbehind;
8 deepnavy MOONSHIFT BUTTON blank withwarmgold rim, no moonicon orwords.
Keep strict eight-itemcount, strict2x4 even grid, no extra icons/particles, no text. These will be sliced into separate PNGsandfontlabelsaddedinUnity. Truealphaoutsideeachpiece, not a black matte or bakedcheckerboard.
